<details><summary>What is a qualified Christmas lighting lead?</summary><p>A prospect whose location, requested service, approximate budget and timing fit the installation company&#x27;s actual requirements.</p></details>
<details><summary>Are exclusive Christmas lighting leads better than shared leads?</summary><p>Exclusive acquisition provides more control over the customer journey, while shared lead services may have different costs and competitive trade-offs. Compare outcomes, not promises.</p></details>
<details><summary>Can Christmas light installation leads book appointments online?</summary><p>Yes. A connected quote funnel and scheduling system can support design visits and remote quote requests, with the appropriate CRM status and follow-up.</p></details>
<details><summary>What should happen after someone requests a Christmas lighting quote?</summary><p>The inquiry should be captured, assigned, qualified and given a clear next step. Automated communication must respect permissions and actual appointment status.</p></details>
